he return report. No more waiting around. Powered by eSignature Collect document e-signatures in minutes and say goodbye to manual printing, stamps and scanning forever. No office required. Powered by Out of Office Hours Take the pressure off your call centre team by enabling customers to head straight into digital self-serve. Powered by Identity Checks Onboard clients in seconds with our self-serve proof of identity accelerator. Rest assured everyone's who they say they are. Powered by Witness Statement Gather witness statements without ever picking up the phone or waiting for a form to be filled in and returned. Powered by 3rd Party Capture Get ahead of the competition to control the claim and capture non-fault 3rd parties, reducing your loss ratios. Powered by eNOL Enable any customer to submit their claim, via any channel, at any time. No downloads required. Powered by Remote Inspections Augment your inspections with images or video content uploaded directly by the customer, using their mobile phone. Easy as pie. Powered by AI Damage Detection/Estimation 90% of repair decisions can now be automated using Artificial Intelligence. Say goodbye to subjectivity. Powered by AI Liability Decision Automate up to 90% of liability decisions, and take a whole lot of paperwork off your own desk with Artificial Intelligence. Powered by Speak to a transformation expert Our experts are here to provide free, impartial advice to help you leverage insurtech and AI. We'll be extra careful with your data. Promise. 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk Platform Technology Buyers Embedded Claims Overview Developers Tools Per Category Home Health Life Motor Personal Injury Claim Technology About Us Contact Us Careers Product Overview Embedded Claims Technology Buyers Partner Program Technology Partners Consultant Partners News Contact 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk",
