loud via a single API and customise Accelerators via a low-code/no-code console Reduce Cost Escape legacy challenges and speed up combined ratio optimisation by deploying pre-built B2B solutions in the cloud with one-click Customer Centricity Provide customers with a single, consistent user experience to self-serve claims with zero-touch from Insurers Future Proof Deploy a cloud-based wrapper on top of your legacy and third-party systems to free up internal IT resources and accelerate digital transformation Sign up to our Partner Program Join the only open finance and insurance innovation platform to unlock your growth potential. Any issues? Just reach out . We'll be extra careful with your data. Promise. By creating an account you agree to our privacy policy . 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk Platform Technology Buyers Embedded Claims Overview Developers Tools Per Category Home Health Life Motor Personal Injury Claim Technology About Us Contact Us Careers Product Overview Embedded Claims Technology Buyers Partner Program Technology Partners Consultant Partners News Contact 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk",
