      "description": "Developers | Claim Technology Product Overview Embedded Claims Technology Buyers Partner Program Technology Partners Consultant Partners News Contact We play well with others We're making a commitment to our customers Our name is Claim Technology, and we’re addicted to cloud. It’s intelligent, it’s quick, it’s cost-effective. Unlike legacy systems, it solves problems and makes things simpler. Hey, y’know what? It’s a lot like us. Leave legacy behind The biggest hurdle to digital transformation is legacy infrastructure. We say, stop adding to that complexity. Instead, use our digital claims core on the cloud, and start innovating faster, from today. No need to update your set-up or architecture, AutoMate will make itself at home with your current systems. API first, API last Our API layer is so clever, it can do multiple jobs at once! Firstly, through our comprehensive API documentation , it allows you quick and simple access to the Claim Technology marketplace, where you can integrate with some of our favourite partners in crime who are revolutionising insurtech, fintech and regtech. If that wasn’t enough, you can sync back and forth with any systems of record. Bet that made your CMS smile, didn’t it? Low code: empower your thinkers Let’s face it, being tied to development is a drag. Instead, make your thinkers the developers, with our unique low-code/no-code environment for building all kinds of nifty processes with no technical background needed. Don’t worry, it’s all flexible too, with a lot of room for customization, and with advanced features for developers, there’s space for them to get involved too. ‘Claim Technology lets us design our own client self-serve tasks with zero dependency on our IT team’ Anthony Fletcher Chief Operating Officer, Vehicle Replacement Group Speak to a transformation expert Our experts are here to provide free, impartial advice to help you leverage insurtech and AI. We'll be extra careful with your data. Promise. 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk Platform Technology Buyers Embedded Claims Overview Developers Tools Per Category Home Health Life Motor Personal Injury Claim Technology About Us Contact Us Careers Product Overview Embedded Claims Technology Buyers Partner Program Technology Partners Consultant Partners News Contact 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk",
