      "description": "About Us | Claim Technology Product Overview Embedded Claims Technology Buyers Partner Program Technology Partners Consultant Partners News Contact We're a little outside the box We don't want to brag... well, okay go on then, pass the mic Winning the 2019 Technology Innovation of the Year award might tell you everything you need to know about our platform, but what about the innovators working behind the scenes? We’re known for being an open book, and for always putting transparency first. So go on, ask us anything. Jonty Hurwitz “Engineer, Artist and Entrepeneur, Jonty is one of the most recognised founders and company-builders in the fintech space. Among his ventures are the design and launch of the Wonga.com technology, design of the of AI investment analyst, Vesti.ai, and a guinness world record for the smallest sculpture of a human form using nano technology. Jonty backs projects that fundamentally shake the status-quo, that challenge inherited assumptions, whether they be in the fields of art, science or business.” Michael Lewis “ Over 20+ years, I’ve learnt from observing how colleagues at Goldman Sachs and IBM both thought and behaved. I’ve gained greater insight from working inside smaller, more challenged companies. My day-job has included CEO, CIO and COO roles but my life’s work has been exploring how we re-evaluate our belief in how companies ought to work and start thinking “upside down” instead. I’m a keen reader and traveller, and happiest spending time with my partner Kat. ” Ashley Preece “Since graduating from Pearson Business School with First Class honours, my focus has been on changing insurance to make it quicker, easier and cheaper for people to become insured or make a claim. This builds on my independent award-winning research into the Asian-Pacific natural disaster insurance gap. In my spare time I enjoy keeping fit in the gym, listening to and also producing music.” ‘Claim Technology's insurance bot store is a must-have for anyone wanting to accelerate customer-centric digital initiatives’ Kobi Bendelak Insurtech Israel Our Technology Partners Speak to a transformation expert Our experts are here to provide free, impartial advice to help you leverage insurtech and AI. We'll be extra careful with your data. Promise. 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk Platform Technology Buyers Embedded Claims Overview Developers Tools Per Category Home Health Life Motor Personal Injury Claim Technology About Us Contact Us Careers Product Overview Embedded Claims Technology Buyers Partner Program Technology Partners Consultant Partners News Contact 71-75 Shelton Street London, WC2H 9JQ United Kingdom hello@claimtechnology.co.uk",
